  "_notes": {
    "why": "Live has breakdown_try>0 but dominant blocker is breakdown_ns_regime. This bounded replay checks if ER gate 0.15 is over-filtering current conditions.",
    "acceptance_for_next_step": "If ER 0.0/0.05 produces materially more trades with PF >= 1.2 and DD <= 8% on this 180d diagnostic, run a 365d promotion replay before any live change.",
